# The admin site is never meant to be framed, indexed, or to leak its URLs.
# No Content-Security-Policy: neither site has one, and adding a first-ever CSP
# is its own change with its own origin inventory, not part of this split.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
